{"3896750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultimate Control Machine", "steam_appid": 3896750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ultimate test to become the world's greatest robot pilot! This fully virtual reality trial will push your control skills, composure, and spatial awareness to their absolute limits. Of course, you can quit anytime… <strong>that is, until an unexpected glitch traps you in the virtual world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Machine is a 3D platformer played using 30 different controllers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the way you control your character will change periodically. Here are a few examples:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/2427d558dd262c1f5df179f81dd697d6.avif?t=1765966775\" width=720 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard WASD controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse right/left click to change direction and the scroll wheel to adjust speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Q to step forward with your left foot, P to step with your right foot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a virtual keyboard on-screen with your mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move a virtual player across a virtual-on-virtual keyboard, which then triggers movement for your real player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A high-difficulty <strong>Precision Platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The VR world corrupted by bugs is a very dangerous place. Due to a twisted physics engine, even a small collision can feel like being hit by a truck. One mistake may erase all your progress and send you back to the start. To reach the end of the stage and escape from this place, you’ll need to take each step extremely carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/31b85e27b5617057bd807ff7de38ef82.poster.avif?t=1765966775\" width=720 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/31b85e27b5617057bd807ff7de38ef82.webm?t=1765966775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/31b85e27b5617057bd807ff7de38ef82.mp4?t=1765966775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ultimate test to become the world's greatest robot pilot! This fully virtual reality trial will push your control skills, composure, and spatial awareness to their absolute limits. Of course, you can quit anytime… <strong>that is, until an unexpected glitch traps you in the virtual world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Control Machine is a 3D platformer played using 30 different controllers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the way you control your character will change periodically. Here are a few examples:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/2427d558dd262c1f5df179f81dd697d6.avif?t=1765966775\" width=720 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard WASD controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse right/left click to change direction and the scroll wheel to adjust speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Q to step forward with your left foot, P to step with your right foot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a virtual keyboard on-screen with your mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move a virtual player across a virtual-on-virtual keyboard, which then triggers movement for your real player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A high-difficulty <strong>Precision Platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The VR world corrupted by bugs is a very dangerous place. Due to a twisted physics engine, even a small collision can feel like being hit by a truck. One mistake may erase all your progress and send you back to the start. To reach the end of the stage and escape from this place, you’ll need to take each step extremely carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/31b85e27b5617057bd807ff7de38ef82.poster.avif?t=1765966775\" width=720 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/31b85e27b5617057bd807ff7de38ef82.webm?t=1765966775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896750/extras/31b85e27b5617057bd807ff7de38ef82.mp4?t=1765966775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A platformer like no other… play with 30 unique controllers! Every stage changes the controls. Master your mouse, your keyboard, and your reflexes in the ultimate test to become the world’s greatest robot pilot!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<s